Online Food Delivery system

Requirement:
    - A restaurent wants to create a Java app to manage online food orders

Explaining current scenario/problem,
    - Orders are written manually
    - Customers details are difficult to track
    - Bill calculation takes time
    - Delivery status is not properly managed


Application should be
1. Store Customer details
2. Display food menu
3. Place food orders
4. Calculate bill amount
5. Display delivery status


